    "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Missing egress endpoint for `releases.astral.sh`**\n\n`astral-sh/setup-uv` v7.6.0 changed the default uv download source from the GitHub API to `releases.astral.sh`. Since this job uses `egress-policy: 'block'`, and `releases.astral.sh` is not in the `allowed-endpoints` list, the `Install uv` step will be blocked by the network firewall and the `build-macos` job will fail. The `vuln-suppression-check.yml` workflow already includes `releases.astral.sh:443` in its egress allowlist — the same needs to be added here.\n\n<a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/ide/cursor?prompt=This%20is%20a%20comment%20left%20during%20a%20code%20review.%0APath%3A%20.github%2Fworkflows%2Fbuild-binary.yml%0ALine%3A%2097-100%0A%0AComment%3A%0A**Missing%20egress%20endpoint%20for%20%60releases.astral.sh%60**%0A%0A%60astral-sh%2Fsetup-uv%60%20v7.6.0%20changed%20the%20default%20uv%20download%20source%20from%20the%20GitHub%20API%20to%20%60releases.astral.sh%60.%20Since%20this%20job%20uses%20%60egress-policy%3A%20'block'%60%2C%20and%20%60releases.astral.sh%60%20is%20not%20in%20the%20%60allowed-endpoints%60%20list%2C%20the%20%60Install%20uv%60%20step%20will%20be%20blocked%20by%20the%20network%20firewall%20and%20the%20%60build-macos%60%20job%20will%20fail.%20The%20%60vuln-suppression-check.yml%60%20workflow%20already%20includes%20%60releases.astral.sh%3A443%60%20in%20its%20egress%20allowlist%20%E2%80%94%20the%20same%20needs%20to%20be%20added%20here.%0A%0AHow%20can%20I%20resolve%20this%3F%20If%20you%20propose%20a%20fix%2C%20please%20make%20it%20concise.&pr=916&platform=github\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCursorDark.svg?v=3\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/FixInCursor.svg?v=3\"><img alt=\"